cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use COBS in your research, please cite this software. The associated article citation and DOI will be added after publication."
type: software
title: "COBS: Crisp to Overlap Boundary Similarity"
abstract: >-
  COBS is a controlled overlapping-community detection framework that starts
  from a crisp partition, identifies boundary nodes, assigns additional
  memberships using node-to-community neighborhood similarity, and applies
  controlled community merging. The software also supports overlapping
  community-consideration centrality and PPI-network analysis.
